==Buy Phase==
===Match Start===
*{{AC|VyseMatchStart1.mp3}} "A battle is just a conflict in need of resolution. Focus on the fix, then execute."
*{{AC|VyseMatchStart2.mp3}} "History doesn't remember the almosts. We'll be the best, or we'll be forgotten."
*{{AC|VyseMatchStart3.mp3}} "I didn't come here to lose. We'll win, or we'll die."
*{{AC|VyseMatchStart4.mp3}} "It's time. Remember your role, keep your nerve, and if all else fails, send them my way."
*{{AC|VyseMatchStart5.mp3}} "Practice is easy, safe, sterile. This is where you are truly measured."
*{{AC|VyseMatchStart6.mp3}} "Our enemies had every chance to back down, but they chose violence, and I choose to reply in kind."
*{{AC|VyseMatchStart7.mp3}} "This is what we trained for. Pick a weapon, choose your sector and fight for your future."

====Attacking====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartAttack1.mp3}} "Five people stand between us and what's ours. Arm up and fight for your future!"
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartAttack2.mp3}} "Our key objectives today are: kill the opposition and plant the spike. Great, very doable."
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartAttack3.mp3}} "Your enemy has everything you need to survive. You have the means to take it, so take it!"

====Defending====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartDefense1.mp3}} "The self-righteous thieves are back. Good, I have plans for them." 
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartDefense2.mp3}} "The temerity, to think they can come and here and take what's ours? No!" 

====[[Abyss]]====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartAbyss.mp3}} "If it were up to me, I'd have [[Raze]] rig this place with explosives and send it crashing into the void."

====[[Icebox]]====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartIcebox.mp3}} "So this is the project that sapped my funding all those years ago. Looks like it worked out well for you, Kingdom." 

====[[Lotus]]====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartLotus.mp3}} "So much to research here, but here we are, about to fill it with bullet holes."

====[[Pearl]]====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartPearl.mp3}} "Hm, impressive engineering for a precarious little place."

====[[Split]]====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartSplit.mp3}} "Why hasn't Kingdom abandoned their headquarters here yet? I would've thought. Huh, so be it."

====[[Sunset]]====
*{{AC|VyseMatchStartSunset.mp3}} "Interverse research causing massive catastrophies. Huh, imagine that."

===Round Start===
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart1.mp3}} "Ability, dedication, time. That's all we need."
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart2.mp3}} "Control the space, control their choices."
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart3.mp3}} "I demand what I'm owed."
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart4.mp3}} "I feel no empathy for them, what does that say about me? Don't answer, it was rhethorical."
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart5.mp3}} "I'll isolate the problem. You crush it."
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart6.mp3}} "Speak up and ask questions, assumptions will only get us in trouble."
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart7.mp3}} "They brought weapons made of metal, to kill me? Huh, ironic."
*{{AC|VyseRoundStart8.mp3}} "This is where someone says something pithy and we pretend to tolerate them. Go ahead, I'll wait."

====Last round won====
*{{AC|VyseRoundWon1.mp3}} "Hm, I'm partial to winning. Let's do more of it."
*{{AC|VyseRoundWon2.mp3}} "Keep pushing, don't give them time to adapt."
*{{AC|VyseRoundWon3.mp3}} "People are all the same. Predictable, punishable."
*{{AC|VyseRoundWon4.mp3}} "Success is the only axis that matters."
*{{AC|VyseRoundWon5.mp3}} "We're finding our feet, excellent."

